000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. PRMCALC0.
000300 AUTHOR. CORVANE MAINFRAME BILLING.
000400*================================================================
000500* PRMCALC0 ONLINE PREMIUM CALCULATION (CICS, CALLED THROUGH CTG)
000600*
000700* CALLER: policy-admin MainframePremiumAdapter, THROUGH CICS
000800* TRANSACTION GATEWAY SERVER CORVCTG1 (IPCONN CORVCTG1 IN
000900* corvmf.csd), WHEN policy.premium-engine = mainframe. THAT FLAG
001000* IS mainframe IN PROD AND java IN DEV AND TEST, SO DEV AND TEST
001100* NEVER EXERCISE THIS PROGRAM.
001200* INPUT/OUTPUT: COMMAREA PRMCOMM (256 BYTES).
001300* SAME STEPS AS THE BATCH PRMCALC: RAT<LINE>01, PRMRULES, EXCESS,
001400* IPTCALC. THE EXCESS PARAGRAPH WAS COPIED FROM PRMCALC IN 2017
001500* AND STILL USES A COMPULSORY EXCESS OF 200.
001600*================================================================
001700 DATA DIVISION.
001800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001900     COPY POLREC.
002000     COPY RATEREC.
002100 01  WS-RATING-PGM               PIC X(08).
002200 01  WS-COMPULSORY-EXCESS        PIC 9(05) VALUE 200.
002300 01  WS-VOL-DISC-PCT             PIC 9(03)V99.
002400 01  WS-EXCESS-DISCOUNT          PIC S9(07)V99 COMP-3.
002500 01  WS-VALID-LINES              PIC X(36)
002600     VALUE 'MTRHOMCNTTRVPETLLDMARCPRPLBPINCYBGDG'.
002700 01  WS-LINE-FOUND               PIC 9(02) VALUE ZERO.
002800 LINKAGE SECTION.
002900 01  DFHCOMMAREA.
003000     COPY PRMCOMM REPLACING ==01  PRMCOMM-AREA.==
003100                         BY ==02  PRMCOMM-AREA.==.
003200 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
003300 0000-MAIN.
003400     IF EIBCALEN < 256
003500         EXEC CICS ABEND ABCODE('PRM1') END-EXEC
003600     END-IF
003700     MOVE ZERO TO RSP-RETURN-CODE
003800     MOVE SPACES TO RSP-MESSAGE
003900     PERFORM 1000-VALIDATE
004000     IF RSP-RETURN-CODE = ZERO
004100         PERFORM 2000-BUILD-POLICY
004200         PERFORM 3000-RATE
004300     END-IF
004400     EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
004500 1000-VALIDATE.
004600     MOVE ZERO TO WS-LINE-FOUND
004700     INSPECT WS-VALID-LINES TALLYING WS-LINE-FOUND
004800         FOR ALL REQ-LINE-CODE
004900     EVALUATE TRUE
005000         WHEN WS-LINE-FOUND = ZERO
005100             MOVE 12 TO RSP-RETURN-CODE
005200             MOVE 'UNKNOWN LINE OF BUSINESS' TO RSP-MESSAGE
005300         WHEN REQ-SUM-INSURED = ZERO
005400             MOVE 12 TO RSP-RETURN-CODE
005500             MOVE 'SUM INSURED IS REQUIRED' TO RSP-MESSAGE
005600         WHEN REQ-REGION NOT = 'UK' AND REQ-REGION NOT = 'US'
005700             MOVE 12 TO RSP-RETURN-CODE
005800             MOVE 'REGION MUST BE UK OR US' TO RSP-MESSAGE
005900     END-EVALUATE.
006000 2000-BUILD-POLICY.
006100     INITIALIZE POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD
006200     MOVE REQ-QUOTE-ID(1:12)    TO POL-NUMBER
006300     MOVE REQ-LINE-CODE         TO POL-LINE-CODE
006400     MOVE REQ-REGION            TO POL-REGION
006500     MOVE REQ-CURRENCY          TO POL-CURRENCY
006600     MOVE REQ-EFFECTIVE-DATE    TO POL-START-DATE
006700     MOVE REQ-SUM-INSURED       TO POL-SUM-INSURED
006800     MOVE REQ-VOLUNTARY-XS      TO POL-VOLUNTARY-EXCESS
006900     MOVE REQ-RISK-SCORE        TO POL-RISK-SCORE
007000     MOVE REQ-POSTCODE          TO INSURED-POSTCODE
007100     MOVE REQ-INSURED-DOB       TO INSURED-DOB
007200     MOVE REQ-RISK-DETAIL       TO POL-RISK-DETAIL
007300     MOVE 'A'                   TO POL-BILL-FREQ
007400     MOVE REQ-LINE-CODE         TO RATE-LINE-CODE
007500     MOVE REQ-REGION            TO RATE-REGION
007600     MOVE REQ-EFFECTIVE-DATE    TO RATE-BILL-DATE
007700     MOVE 'N'                   TO RATE-REFER-FLAG.
007800 3000-RATE.
007900     STRING 'RAT' REQ-LINE-CODE '01' DELIMITED BY SIZE
008000         INTO WS-RATING-PGM
008100     EXEC CICS LINK PROGRAM(WS-RATING-PGM)
008200               COMMAREA(POL-RECORD) LENGTH(400)
008300               NOHANDLE
008400     END-EXEC
008500     CALL WS-RATING-PGM USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD
008600         ON EXCEPTION
008700             MOVE 90 TO RSP-RETURN-CODE
008800             MOVE 'NO RATING PROGRAM FOR LINE' TO RSP-MESSAGE
008900     END-CALL
009000     IF RSP-RETURN-CODE = ZERO
009100         CALL 'PRMRULES' USING POL-RECORD RATE-RECORD
009200         PERFORM 3100-APPLY-EXCESS
009300         COMPUTE RATE-NET-PREMIUM ROUNDED =
009400             RATE-BASE-PREMIUM + RATE-LOADINGS - RATE-DISCOUNTS
009500         CALL 'IPTCALC' USING RATE-LINE-CODE RATE-REGION
009600                              RATE-NET-PREMIUM RATE-IPT-RATE
009700                              RATE-IPT-AMT
009800         MOVE RATE-BASE-PREMIUM TO RSP-BASE-PREMIUM
009900         MOVE RATE-LOADINGS     TO RSP-LOADINGS
010000         MOVE RATE-DISCOUNTS    TO RSP-DISCOUNTS
010100         MOVE RATE-IPT-AMT      TO RSP-IPT-AMT
010200         COMPUTE RSP-TOTAL-PREMIUM = RATE-NET-PREMIUM
010300                                   + RATE-IPT-AMT
010400         MOVE RATE-REFER-FLAG   TO RSP-REFER-FLAG
010500         IF RATE-REFER
010600             MOVE 08 TO RSP-RETURN-CODE
010700             MOVE 'REFER TO UNDERWRITER' TO RSP-MESSAGE
010800         END-IF
010900     END-IF.
011000 3100-APPLY-EXCESS.
011100*    COPIED FROM PRMCALC 3000-APPLY-EXCESS (2017). KEEP IN STEP.
011200     MOVE WS-COMPULSORY-EXCESS TO RATE-EXCESS-COMPULSORY
011300     COMPUTE RSP-EXCESS-TOTAL = WS-COMPULSORY-EXCESS
011400                              + REQ-VOLUNTARY-XS
011500     COMPUTE WS-VOL-DISC-PCT = (REQ-VOLUNTARY-XS / 100) * 5
011600     IF WS-VOL-DISC-PCT > 20
011700         MOVE 20 TO WS-VOL-DISC-PCT
011800     END-IF
011900     COMPUTE WS-EXCESS-DISCOUNT ROUNDED =
012000         RATE-BASE-PREMIUM * WS-VOL-DISC-PCT / 100
012100     ADD WS-EXCESS-DISCOUNT TO RATE-DISCOUNTS.
